  ('7036e8f5-2044-524b-a80f-66e5d516b892', '38bf5630-62ec-54d4-af2b-f9b4c804b5f3', 13, 'The Ashwright', 'In which residents speak of the Ashwright, a figure in a grey coat seen on rooftops before every scraping. Pell claims she has seen its face.

