  ('ba353e7e-8e16-5296-a52f-ab82bf7eb5f5', '38bf5630-62ec-54d4-af2b-f9b4c804b5f3', 14, 'Pell''s Secret', 'In which Pell admits she was born in a house that was scraped away. Her parents vanished with it. She joined Ilse hoping the map could bring them back.

Below the bridges the canal ran black and slow, carrying the day''s scraped lines out toward the sea.

