The galley smelled of reheated noodles and coffee that had been on the warmer since last shift.

Ama had spent four years listening to other people''s messages. She had never expected one to be addressed to her.

At 03:12 the next night, the relay chimed again.', 'published', now() - interval '4.830 days', now() - interval '4.830 days'),
