  ('0978cbea-d447-5038-a6ab-6de455a0d698', 'e52b45b3-2a54-56cf-acb1-0637ace80fa8', 9, 'The Second Gate', 'In which under pressure in the trials, Wei Lan breaks through the second gate. Her qi turns silver, a colour that makes the examining elders go quiet.

Mist clung to the nine peaks of the Azure Summit, and the bells of the inner sect drifted down through it like falling leaves.

