values ('889c7e53-53ba-5022-a566-f39b3dc8b12c', 'dab4cd47-fa16-5b6d-aa59-526c7ac4c165', 'The Silk Exchange Murders', 'the-silk-exchange-murders', 'Smyrna, 1893. When a silk merchant is found strangled with his own finest thread inside the locked Exchange, translator Leyla Safi is hired to read his ledgers in five languages. The police want a quick answer. The merchants want silence. Leyla wants to know why every page she translates seems to have been written for her alone.', 'completed', 'teen', now() - interval '150.86 days')
