  ('faa72b17-5cdd-5e97-a324-8cf482871c1c', '889c7e53-53ba-5022-a566-f39b3dc8b12c', 22, 'The Trap at the Exchange', 'In which Leyla announces she will read the full accounts aloud at the Exchange. Demir, Aris and Vasse hide in the gallery to catch whoever comes to stop her.

