  ('38635a3a-03e4-5531-aace-f058803ec55d', '889c7e53-53ba-5022-a566-f39b3dc8b12c', 25, 'The Translator''s Fee', 'In which The Governor offers Leyla a reward. She asks instead for the right to work as a sworn court translator, the first woman in Smyrna to hold the title.

