  ('185019f6-ecd2-5b67-a7cd-1f757e1ac840', 'd7c9dac0-6e19-521b-ae48-f40d07b58268', 15, 'Isla''s Story', 'In which Isla tells how the smugglers came to kill Angus for refusing to signal again. She lit the lamp to warn him, and he escaped in her place on the ferry.

