  ('d68bd0e7-d6b9-5a0a-ae15-0725e7f73d28', 'd7c9dac0-6e19-521b-ae48-f40d07b58268', 16, 'Who Stayed', 'In which Isla explains that Angus took her identity and her ferry ticket. She stayed on the island as ''herself'', then left a week later, and the island chose to say he drowned.

