  ('29f72aa5-4c7a-5bbe-ab18-9b6bd2526805', 'd7c9dac0-6e19-521b-ae48-f40d07b58268', 19, 'The Keeper Comes Home', 'In which Angus, old and frail, asks to see the lighthouse one last time before it is sold. The island argues for a night, then agrees.

