  ('7bb00c04-b894-5682-a418-c45ba234d018', 'd7c9dac0-6e19-521b-ae48-f40d07b58268', 20, 'The Lamp', 'In which Angus returns to Skerrow. The island gathers on the headland as he climbs the tower and lights the lamp one final time.

