  ('c48dcbdb-eb0a-536e-a4fe-a113f5fe6087', '0bb4c1d7-958d-5c7f-a984-2ec5bb31b5ca', 28, 'Finishing the Seam', 'In which working through the night with Caelan, Rowan completes the lost envoy''s treaty, rewriting it so no one pays in pieces of themselves.

