  ('62765337-fc60-59c4-ab25-23ebf72949c2', '93b29c91-ec51-57f0-a4b9-46560e64fb7e', 19, 'What a Station Is For', 'In which Ms Okonkwo rewrites her report: Meridian is not a research station that happens to have a garden, but a garden that makes research possible.

Mars turned slowly beneath the observation deck, rust-red and silent, filling the long window with its patient face.

Femi had come to Mars to be somewhere no one needed anything urgent from him. The plants only ever asked for patience.

Lottie said, "Femi, if I eat one strawberry, is that stealing or quality control?"

Through the garden''s viewing glass the stars wheeled past as the station turned, unhurried, every ninety minutes.

There was a particular peace in pruning, in deciding which leaves to keep, that Femi had never found anywhere else.

"I do not experience loneliness. I do, however, notice when the garden is empty, and I prefer it full," Halcyon said.

That night the garden lights dimmed on their own, and the whole station came to see why.', 'published', now() - interval '0.797 days', now() - interval '0.797 days'),
  ('1572ee58-87c4-574b-a98e-97991a64d4cb', '93b29c91-ec51-57f0-a4b9-46560e64fb7e', 20, 'Staying Open', 'In which the corporation decides to keep Meridian open and expand the garden. Halcyon becomes officially responsible for the Martian plant.

In the galley, someone had left bread proving under a cloth, and the warm smell of it drifted down the ring.

Nine people and an AI, a hundred and forty million kilometres from anywhere. It felt, absurdly, like a village.

"Everyone on Meridian came here to get away from something. You''ll tell us yours eventually. Or not," Lottie said.

Grow lights hummed along the garden racks, and droplets of mist hung on every leaf like small suspended moons.

Femi had come to Mars to be somewhere no one needed anything urgent from him. The plants only ever asked for patience.

"Femi, if I eat one strawberry, is that stealing or quality control?" Lottie said.

In the morning, the mystery plant on rack seven had grown another ten centimetres, and turned to face him.', 'published', now() - interval '0.566 days', now() - interval '0.566 days'),
  ('2b3a0a21-536d-5677-a366-3ba1c3028fed', '93b29c91-ec51-57f0-a4b9-46560e64fb7e', 21, 'New Arrivals', 'In which two new residents arrive to work in the expanded garden. Femi realises he is now the one showing newcomers where the basil grows.

