  ('43f0c3af-d96e-5c90-a98f-d19b6a444bd1', '93b29c91-ec51-57f0-a4b9-46560e64fb7e', 22, 'Night Cycle', 'In which on the station''s anniversary, the residents gather in the garden in the dark. The Martian flowers glow, and Halcyon asks if this is what home feels like.

